# DESK38 -- *Show info* on a WINDOW item and on a desktop SHORTCUT.
#
#   B_WIN1       the C:\ window open
#   C_FILEINFO   ADFFINFO for C:\README.TXT (the window arm of do_info)
#   D_CANCEL     its Cancel taken -- `inf_file_folder` -> InfFF::Cancel, which
#                is `do_info`'s 0 and ends the SHOWITEM loop
#   E_SHORTCUT   README.TXT dragged onto the desktop surface (DESK30)
#   F_SCSEL      the shortcut selected (g_cwin is DESKWH again)
#   G_SCINFO     ADFFINFO for the shortcut -- the `AF_ISDESK` arm, whose
#                fields come from `file_exists(a_pappl)` and not from an FNODE
#
# Coordinates from the probe run: C: icon (38,35); 'README.TXT' in window 1 at
# (179,271); the free bottom-row desktop cell at (220,449) (the DESK30 run's).
# File title hover (88,9), "Info/Rename..." (152,43).
# The ADFFINFO buttons are filled in from this run's own [dlg] dump.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1600 move 38 35
1800 down
1803 up
1810 down
1813 up
2400 move 600 240
3200 mark B_WIN1
3600 move 179 271
4000 down
4003 up
4400 parkbr
5000 mark B2_FILESEL
5400 move 88 240
5600 move 88 9
6200 move 152 43
6800 down
7000 up
7600 parkbr
8600 mark C_FILEINFO
# -- Cancel the box (395,319 from this run's [dlg] dump), then make a desktop
#    shortcut out of README.TXT and ask again.
9000 move 395 319
9400 down
9600 up
10200 parkbr
11000 mark D_CANCEL
11400 move 179 271
11800 down
11900 drag 250 458
12500 up
12800 move 600 300
13600 mark E_SHORTCUT
14000 move 220 449
14400 down
14403 up
14800 parkbr
15400 mark F_SCSEL
15800 move 88 240
16000 move 88 9
16600 move 152 43
17200 down
17400 up
18000 parkbr
19000 mark G_SCINFO
19400 move 395 319
19800 down
20000 up
20600 parkbr
21400 mark H_END
